{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk</strong>, <strong>run</strong>, <strong>jump</strong>, <strong>climb</strong>, <strong>fly</strong> and generally <strong>puzzle</strong> your way into the heart of a mysterious space craft.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/5d5ab6053c1cfb7e57015ae3bf91172f.avif?t=1761934366\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long since thought to have met an untimely end (on its mission to search for life in the far reaches of the cosmos) it appears like a celestial giant on the radar of the ISS Space Recovery And Rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/0d18482de7dd87fdff583a8a0c56ce54.avif?t=1761934366\" width=616 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solitary Joybot wakes from sleep and runs diagnostics as it awaits docking to begin its investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/dafbe95793ec087296593aa624d0f25f.avif?t=1761934366\" width=616 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stepping aboard the place appears to be rundown with sign of damage to walkways and interior walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/819a4c8c12a0204fca8c7932930a4640.avif?t=1761934366\" width=616 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no sign of any crew but there are signs of different forms of life all around. A mould like substance grows amid the potted plants that still seem to flourish along the corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to use skills and cunning to make your way to the heart of the ship and uncover the truth that lies within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/851d85607af5767abc5a77effb842b69.avif?t=1761934366\" width=616 height=196 /></span>To keep up to date on all things Control Yourself don't forget to wishlist now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also <strong>251789</strong> ...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2733870?t=1761934366","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2733870?t=1761934366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/644dcd8f532b3e128acf80dcdc927cccd146203a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761934366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/644dcd8f532b3e128acf80dcdc927cccd146203a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761934366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Walk</strong>, <strong>run</strong>, <strong>jump</strong>, <strong>climb</strong>, <strong>fly</strong> and generally <strong>puzzle</strong> your way into the heart of a mysterious space craft.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/5d5ab6053c1cfb7e57015ae3bf91172f.avif?t=1761934366\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long since thought to have met an untimely end (on its mission to search for life in the far reaches of the cosmos) it appears like a celestial giant on the radar of the ISS Spac